#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:1
msgid "Songjiang G60 innovation services"
msgstr "松江区G60科创服务部门"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:4
msgid "松江区G60科创服务部门"
msgstr "松江区G60科创服务部门"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:6
msgid "Government | Songjiang | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "政府部门｜松江区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:8
msgid ""
"The G60 Sci-Tech Innovation Valley publishes innovation and "
"resource-matching initiatives. We distinguish the nine-city corridor from "
"Shanghai district eligibility: a partner elsewhere in the corridor does "
"not establish Songjiang qualification."
msgstr "G60科创走廊发布创新与资源对接举措。九城市合作范围与上海区级资格不同，走廊其他城市的合作伙伴不能据此取得松江申报资格。"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:10
msgid ""
"`Evidence S094 <https://english.songjiang.gov.cn/news/3249.shtml>`_. G60 "
"unveils comprehensive support plan to fuel innovation valley | Songjiang."
msgstr "`证据 S094 <https://english.songjiang.gov.cn/news/3249.shtml>`_. G60 unveils comprehensive support plan to fuel innovation valley | Songjiang."

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:12
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:15
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:17
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "本条未核实统一现金资助、免费权益或股权比例，请索取现行书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:19
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:22
msgid "`Official website / intake route <https://www.songjiang.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官网／对接入口 <https://www.songjiang.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:24
msgid ""
"A direct program phone or email is not verified here. Use the official "
"route and request the responsible team; no contact has been invented."
msgstr "本版未核实项目直线电话或邮箱。请通过官方渠道索取负责团队，本图谱不编造联系人。"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:26
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:28
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../entities/government-songjiang.rst:41
msgid ":doc:`Songjiang district route </districts/songjiang>`"
msgstr ":doc:`松江区对接路径 </districts/songjiang>`"
